Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.14,0:03:01.67,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Did you see the movie \Neveryone's talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.67,0:03:03.27,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,The one based on a fairy tale?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.90,0:03:07.43,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,The live-action adaptation? Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.43,0:03:08.63,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Was it good?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.01,0:03:10.17,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.17,0:03:13.54,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,It looked gorgeous, and the \Ndresses were beautiful, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.13,0:03:20.87,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You're really girly, huh? \NNot what I'd have expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.45,0:03:25.05,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,It's not like I have particularly \Ngirlish tastes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.14,0:03:25.39,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs8\shad0\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&HA87587&\3a&H77&\frz22.66\pos(138,224.667)}Nekozaki\NWhere are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.39,0:03:26.89,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs20\shad0\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&H5D444D&\3a&H77&\frz22.66\bord4\pos(180.667,285.334)}Nekozaki \NWhere are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.89,0:03:28.14,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs20\shad0\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&H5D444D&\3a&H77&\frz22.66\bord4\pos(180.667,285.334)}Nekozaki \NGot a favor to ask. Would you\Nmind?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.11,0:03:31.55,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,It's no use, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.95,0:03:37.26,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Girls who just wait around aren't \Nexactly en vogue right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.85,0:03:41.48,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Huh? A lot of people go to see \Nmovies like that, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.87,0:03:45.06,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Maybe because that's how \Nthey wish things could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.52,0:03:50.42,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,That someday their prince on a white \Nhorse will come, and they'll be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.04,0:03:53.00,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Is that really how it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.88,0:03:58.70,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Wait, Kamiya-san, did seeing that movie make \Nyou want to ask me about Shikimori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.09,0:04:01.70,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.10,0:04:06.09,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You were so intense about it. \NI wondered what was up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.26,0:04:09.21,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Kamiya-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.69,0:04:14.72,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,"Anything important to you should be kept \Nwithin your heart and not shared,"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.72,0:04:15.76,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,or so they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.15,0:04:17.35,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Or so who says?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.51,0:04:24.00,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,The girl in the movie whose \Nlove wasn't realized.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.37,0:04:26.35,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I-I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.09,0:04:30.95,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd have this \Nconversation with you, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.55,0:04:34.05,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Is it weird? Does it not suit me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.51,0:04:37.69,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Or it just... isn't like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.42,0:04:41.22,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,No, I'm enjoying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.20,0:04:45.35,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,I'm glad, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.78,0:04:48.22,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Kamiya? You here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.50,0:04:49.67,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.67,0:04:51.85,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Nekozaki-san? What brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.16,0:04:53.94,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Oh, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.94,0:04:55.29,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,I need to borrow Kamiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.85,0:04:56.85,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\fs12\fscx97\c&H605F6E&\3c&HE9E9E2&\shad0\pos(207.333,158.667)\frx0\fry352\frz1.692}Cultural F{\3c&HFBFDFE&}estival Venue
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.85,0:04:56.85,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\shad0\c&HF9F9F8&\be1\pos(234.667,226)}m 0 0 l 32 0 l 32 30 l 0 30
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.85,0:04:56.85,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\c&HB8D6EA&\bord0\shad0\an7\fs5\b1\u1\pos(220,197)}The library is\N\Nopen as a\N\Nrest area.\N\N{\c&H7E8CD6&\fscx70\u0}-Library Committee
Dialogue: 2,0:04:55.85,0:04:56.85,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\c&H87869D&\bord0\shad0\an7\fs5\pos(220,197)\b1}The library is\N\Nopen as a\N\Nrest area.\N\N{\c&H7E8CD6&\fscx70}-Library Committee
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.85,0:04:59.94,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! If it's not too much trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.94,0:05:02.85,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,would you please trade numbers with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.11,0:05:05.00,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.54,0:05:07.97,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,You're Shikimori-san... right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.41,0:05:10.50,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,What's this about, Nekozaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.79,0:05:13.09,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,You know the Couple Numbers game, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.09,0:05:15.75,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,She wants to trade her number for yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.75,0:05:18.25,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Why my number?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.55,0:05:20.73,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,W-Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.73,0:05:25.25,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Because you have the same \Nnumber as the person I like.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.51,0:05:30.30,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\fs12\fscx97\c&H605F6E&\3c&HE9E9E2&\shad0\pos(207.333,158.667)\frx0\fry352\frz1.692}Cultural F{\3c&HFBFDFE&}estival Venue
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.51,0:05:30.30,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\shad0\c&HF9F9F8&\be1\pos(234.667,226)}m 0 0 l 32 0 l 32 30 l 0 30
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.51,0:05:30.30,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\c&HB8D6EA&\bord0\shad0\an7\fs5\b1\u1\pos(220,197)}The library is\N\Nopen as a\N\Nrest area.\N\N{\c&H7E8CD6&\fscx70\u0}-Library Committee
Dialogue: 2,0:05:26.51,0:05:30.30,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\c&H87869D&\bord0\shad0\an7\fs5\pos(220,197)\b1}The library is\N\Nopen as a\N\Nrest area.\N\N{\c&H7E8CD6&\fscx70}-Library Committee
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.01,0:05:29.16,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,In that case, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.16,0:05:30.29,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.64,0:05:32.80,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,See? I told you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.80,0:05:36.68,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Kamiya's not interested in this \Nkinda thing, so it's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.68,0:05:38.72,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.56,0:05:44.20,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,It's hot in the hallway. \NWhy don't you talk in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.55,0:05:46.41,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Wait, Shikimori-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.41,0:05:49.57,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I-I came to get you because I figured \Nyour shift would be over soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.82,0:05:51.81,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,O-Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.81,0:05:53.79,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,What were they talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.74,0:05:57.27,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,It's okay. You can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.27,0:05:58.83,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,I'll handle the last twenty minutes—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.83,0:05:59.55,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.29,0:06:03.16,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I can't force you to do \Nthe work by yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.10,0:06:08.64,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Okay... You're rather diligent, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.89,0:06:16.66,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Micchon, have a seat and wait in here, \Nwhere it's nice and cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.66,0:06:17.92,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,S-Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.43,0:06:21.03,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Hachimitsu should have come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.93,0:06:21.75,Main - Top,Izumi,0,0,0,,Thanks for being so considerate, Kamiya-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.03,0:06:22.80,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,That shy, little dork!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.77,0:06:48.92,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Thanks for everything today, Kamiya-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.45,0:06:51.59,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'm glad we had the chance to talk so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.59,0:06:52.72,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.89,0:06:56.10,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Yeah, later.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:11.24,0:07:14.12,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(97,202)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&H221D3C&\bord0\shad0\be.25\fsp2}C{\alpha&HFF&\t(108,149,1 \alpha&H00&)}afé
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.03,0:07:14.11,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.65,0:07:15.88,Main,2-1 Girl 1,0,0,0,,Kamiya-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.24,0:07:19.17,Main,Guy Classmate,0,0,0,,Kamiya! We've been waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.17,0:07:21.13,Main,Guy Classmate,0,0,0,,Now we can make up for lost time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.13,0:07:23.24,Main,Girl Classmate,0,0,0,,Kamiya! Took you long enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.24,0:07:26.77,Main,Guy Classmate,0,0,0,,With Kamiya-san here, \Nour profits will soar!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.77,0:07:29.01,Main,Girl Classmate,0,0,0,,All right! Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.01,0:07:31.57,Main,Girl1,0,0,0,,Who is she? She's so pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.57,0:07:33.88,Main,Girl2,0,0,0,,And so tall! She looks like a model!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.88,0:07:35.18,Main,Guy1,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.18,0:07:36.44,Main,Guy2,0,0,0,,Wanna try talking to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.44,0:07:37.39,Main,Guy3,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.64,0:07:39.27,Main,Guy1,0,0,0,,Apparently, she's single.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.27,0:07:41.14,Main,Guy3,0,0,0,,For real?! I'm going for it, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.55,0:07:43.01,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Thank you for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.24,0:07:44.37,Main,Guy,0,0,0,,Kamiya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.37,0:07:45.65,Main,Guy,0,0,0,,Come here a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.36,0:07:48.02,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Please enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.29,0:07:51.39,Main,Guy,0,0,0,,We get tons more customers \Nwhen she's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.39,0:07:53.28,Main,Girl,0,0,0,,Should we just have her stand by the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.58,0:07:56.29,Main,Guy,0,0,0,,Hey, looks like we could talk to her now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.29,0:07:59.28,Main,Guy,0,0,0,,Don't bother. She won't \Ngive you the time of day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.28,0:08:03.67,Main,Girl,0,0,0,,She has a great figure. \NI bet she'd look good in anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.91,0:08:11.00,Main,Guy,0,0,0,,Maybe she's not interested in other people?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.99,0:08:12.95,Main - Top,Girl,0,0,0,,Hey, let's ask for another \Npicture with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.21,0:08:13.38,Main,Guy,0,0,0,,She just seems way out of reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.13,0:08:14.11,Main,Girl,0,0,0,,I wonder what she's into.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.70,0:08:14.44,Main - Top,Girl,0,0,0,,Maybe she's fine with just standing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.77,0:08:15.32,Main,Girl,0,0,0,,I wanna talk to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.20,0:08:16.63,Main,Guy,0,0,0,,Nah, I bet there's a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.77,0:08:16.89,Main - Top,Guy,0,0,0,,She looks super athletic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.31,0:08:18.33,Main,Girl,0,0,0,,I wonder why she's just standing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.97,0:08:18.33,Main,Girl,0,0,0,,Wanna try asking for her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.12,0:08:19.43,Main - Top,Guy,0,0,0,,Why don't you try just saying hi?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.63,0:08:19.23,Main - Top,Girl,0,0,0,,I wonder if she'd come up in a search...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.17,0:08:21.22,Main,Girl Classmate,0,0,0,,Kamiya?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.22,0:08:22.26,Main,Girl Classmate,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.03,0:08:25.93,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Sorry... I need to step out for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.52,0:08:34.44,Italics,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Man, I never would've thought \Nshe'd show up herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.76,0:08:40.20,Italics,Kamiya,0,0,0,,But she seemed like a nice, honest girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.75,0:08:42.51,Italics,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Nothing like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.58,0:08:48.33,Italics,Kamiya,0,0,0,,I need to just throw these \Nfeelings away already.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.50,0:08:50.68,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Kamiya-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.73,0:08:54.50,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Did you need something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.62,0:09:00.02,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I came to return this. \NI felt like I was being unfair.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.42,0:09:04.47,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Everyone swaps numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.47,0:09:06.14,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,I don't think there's \Nanything unfair about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.77,0:09:08.61,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,That's not what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.15,0:09:11.64,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,This is something I can't take from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.36,0:09:14.77,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Kamiya-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.41,0:09:18.64,Italics,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.58,0:09:24.67,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Kamiya-san, you're not hurt, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.93,0:09:26.62,Flashback,Kamiya,0,0,0,,No, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.98,0:09:30.37,Flashback,Kamiya,0,0,0,,You're the one who got hurt, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.37,0:09:32.54,Flashback,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Why'd the bookshelf suddenly fall over?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.85,0:09:34.58,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Sorry, Kamiya-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.58,0:09:37.95,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,This was my fault. \NYou shouldn't have to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.95,0:09:41.09,Flashback,Kamiya,0,0,0,,It was just a fluke. \NIt's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.44,0:09:43.85,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,You really are nice, Kamiya-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.42,0:09:45.68,Flashback,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.12,0:09:50.99,Flashback,Kamiya,0,0,0,,I get a lot of "she acts so cool" and \N"I can't guess what she's thinking," but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.99,0:09:52.25,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.26,0:09:54.82,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,You {\i1}are{\i0} nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.69,0:10:01.00,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.13,0:10:06.23,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I think I'm the only one \Nwho's figured it out,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.69,0:10:07.96,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,but the way you acted earlier...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.93,0:10:15.55,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,And why did that make you \Nwant to return this to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.55,0:10:19.09,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,You didn't come to tell me not \Nto ever go near him again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.09,0:10:23.09,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,No. I just didn't want to \Ndo anything rude to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.28,0:10:30.78,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Because I don't think anyone who \Nlikes the person I like can be bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.02,0:10:38.67,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,If you really felt nothing at all when \Nyou gave it to me, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.27,0:10:40.11,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.80,0:10:46.00,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,if I made you lie and caused you \Npain, that's unfair to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.38,0:10:48.69,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.11,0:10:52.40,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Isn't this basically helping your enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.40,0:10:53.49,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.86,0:10:55.75,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Izumi-san would probably do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.86,0:11:00.59,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Yeah... I can definitely see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.39,0:11:03.83,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.83,0:11:04.99,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.99,0:11:07.02,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,I don't need that after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.02,0:11:07.63,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.26,0:11:11.26,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,What I had was just a piece of paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.56,0:11:13.01,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.01,0:11:15.78,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,You don't need to worry so much about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.21,0:11:18.79,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,I have no intention of ever \Ntelling him how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.27,0:11:22.64,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,I never intended for anyone to ever find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.54,0:11:25.63,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,I guess I wronged you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.01,0:11:28.31,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to make you \Nfeel bad or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.57,0:11:31.73,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.53,0:11:34.54,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.55,0:11:41.80,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\fs20\fay-.09\shad0\c&H142499&\3c&H5885D1&\pos(294.667,141)}Library
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.90,0:11:55.87,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.63,0:12:00.40,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Sorry I couldn't immediately throw it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.47,0:12:03.75,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,I won't ever come near him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.74,0:12:09.13,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Huh? What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.23,0:12:14.41,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,I don't understand it, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.41,0:12:21.04,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,His quiet kindness made me feel more \Ncomfortable around him than anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.67,0:12:23.21,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,That's all it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.89,0:12:28.48,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,He thinks of me as a friend, \Nand I'm betraying him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.30,0:12:31.40,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Even though he has you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.41,0:12:38.01,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Why couldn't we have just become friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.01,0:12:49.13,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Let's stop this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.73,0:13:00.13,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I never meant to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.39,0:13:04.35,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You don't need to apologize to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.35,0:13:06.93,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,and I can't make up your mind for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.05,0:13:10.64,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I don't know anything about you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.10,0:13:13.31,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,but there is one thing I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.97,0:13:19.05,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You're trying to sacrifice your feelings,\N for Izumi-san and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.63,0:13:23.19,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I don't care if you think\N I'm acting high-and-mighty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.79,0:13:26.37,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,It still makes me happy
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.86,0:13:29.57,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,that you're such a kind person.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.15,0:13:36.41,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,So you should cherish \Nthose feelings you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.02,0:13:50.84,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Sorry. I'm okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.33,0:13:55.59,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Anyway, shouldn't you \Nget back to Izumi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.59,0:13:57.77,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,He's probably gonna start \Ncrying any time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.77,0:13:59.47,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.88,0:14:02.17,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.42,0:14:04.60,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.38,0:14:09.54,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Yeah! See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.47,0:14:23.26,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,Jeez... How long has it been since \NI last cried in front of someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.83,0:14:27.00,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,She really is something, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.39,0:14:29.83,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,letting someone like me \Ncry on her shoulder...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.28,0:14:38.58,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,I'm so glad she's his girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.12,0:14:42.71,Main,Kamiya,0,0,0,,I hope they'll be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.71,0:14:48.52,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,It's the last day of the festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.06,0:14:50.53,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,And today is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.94,0:14:55.00,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,exactly one year since we started dating, \Nand Shikimori-san's birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.45,0:14:58.55,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I found that out too late to \Ncongratulate her last year...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.78,0:15:01.61,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,My birthday? It was last month.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.61,0:15:02.93,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.34,0:15:05.67,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,So this year I went shopping in advance...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.67,0:15:11.00,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,U-U-U-Um, I want to give \Nmy g-girlfriend a gift...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.00,0:15:12.96,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,C-Can you recommend anyfing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.35,0:15:16.15,Flashback,Clerk,0,0,0,,Hearts are always popular \Nfor things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.54,0:15:19.82,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,This year, I'm giving her a gift!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.23,0:15:21.74,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'm off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.74,0:15:24.69,Main,Mom,0,0,0,,Oh, you're leaving early today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.69,0:15:27.07,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I left early the past two days, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.07,0:15:28.62,Main,Mom,0,0,0,,Did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.95,0:15:33.95,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fs18\b1\fnArial\c&H49BCF5&\3c&HEBF5F3&\4c&H67A3AB&\bord2\shad0\i0\pos(364,92)}A{\c&H1232C8&}ni{\c&H64D36C&}ma{\c&H3030E2&}l {\c&HD6A063&}Café
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.95,0:15:33.95,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Check out our animal café!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.95,0:15:36.43,Main,Guy,0,0,0,,Quit pushing! I said stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.95,0:15:40.54,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(320.667,7.333)\an8\fnArial\b1\fs16\c&H2E4262&\3c&H96ECE7&\4c&H4B73B1&}Accurate
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.43,0:15:38.48,Main,Girl,0,0,0,,Wow! He's right again!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.48,0:15:40.53,Main,Guy,0,0,0,,That's crazy! How's he doing it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.54,0:15:47.17,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&H463E48&\3c&HF6F8F8&\shad0\an8\fs20\move(510,32,510,232,19,2614)}Okonomiyaki\NMonjayaki
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.72,0:15:47.17,Main,Guy in Charge,0,0,0,,All right, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.37,0:15:49.98,Main,Guy in Charge,0,0,0,,Great work over these past \Nthree festival days!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.98,0:15:50.93,Main,Guy in Charge,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.19,0:15:52.67,Main,All,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.67,0:15:55.05,Main,Inu/Neko,0,0,0,,Tears!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.68,0:15:56.06,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\p1\c&H000000&\fscx400\fscy250\shad0\1a&HDD&\pos(415,145)\3c&HFFFFFF&}m 0 0 l -20 0 b -22 0 -24 -1 -24 -4 b -24 -9 -24 -15 -24 -20 b -24 -23 -23 -24 -20 -24 b -7 -24 7 -24 20 -24 b 23 -24 24 -23 24 -20 b 24 -15 24 -9 24 -4 b 24 -1 23 0 20 0
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.68,0:15:56.06,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\b1\pos(320,30)\an8}Ranked 8th\Nin Festival Profits
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.51,0:15:59.20,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I can tell you two are bummed about losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.20,0:16:04.23,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,If we'd ranked first in profits, \Nwe would've gotten free after-party tickets!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.23,0:16:06.91,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,So now we're paying for this \Nout of our own pockets!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.95,0:16:10.92,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I hope Izumi-san will be okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.57,0:16:12.90,Main - Top,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,The free food I was dreaming of...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.92,0:16:13.69,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Can those two get drunk on juice?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.23,0:16:16.87,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Which class ended up coming in first?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.29,0:16:23.72,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Oh... Apparently, the third-year class with \Nthe fortune-telling booth won by a mile.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.72,0:16:24.83,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.83,0:16:28.00,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I guess the third-years \Nreally did go all-out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.00,0:16:28.79,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.18,0:16:33.10,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,I thought we were doing pretty good...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.75,0:16:36.89,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Hey, show me your Couple Numbers photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.89,0:16:38.65,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,You swapped numbers, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.65,0:16:39.34,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.90,0:16:42.14,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,W-We didn't take one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.35,0:16:44.38,Main,Hachi/Neko,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.22,0:16:48.02,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,When did you show up, Nekozaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.02,0:16:49.96,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Who cares?! Explain, Micchon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.96,0:16:51.36,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Uh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.62,0:16:54.10,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.10,0:16:57.34,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,What?! C'mon, you're not Izumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.34,0:16:58.32,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,What about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.77,0:17:00.55,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I got careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.55,0:17:01.97,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Aw, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.97,0:17:03.57,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,I'm gonna call you Ditzymori.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.57,0:17:05.78,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,We'll get first place next year!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.29,0:17:07.48,Main,Guy Classmate,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.48,0:17:08.72,Main,Classmate,0,0,0,,See you next week!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.72,0:17:10.19,Main,Classmate,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.12,0:17:13.47,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.47,0:17:14.34,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.63,0:17:19.09,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Do you still have some time? \NWant to go to the park?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.99,0:17:22.24,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,S-Sure, that's fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.64,0:17:28.64,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Wh-What did you want to talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.64,0:17:31.92,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,W-Well... um...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.36,0:17:36.11,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Happy birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.81,0:17:41.64,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,A-Also... it's our first \Nanniversary, kinda?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.64,0:17:43.57,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,They ended up being the same gift...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.57,0:17:47.62,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I don't know much about accessories and \Nstuff, so I don't know if you'll like it...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.01,0:17:49.60,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.02,0:17:52.39,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.71,0:18:00.33,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'm glad you seem to feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.33,0:18:01.07,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.62,0:18:07.02,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You've been acting a bit off since you came \Nback from whatever you had to do yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.73,0:18:09.53,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I wondered if something happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.96,0:18:15.77,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,No, nothing happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.03,0:18:19.48,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Can I open this now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.48,0:18:20.28,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.50,0:18:25.85,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Oh, how cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.46,0:18:29.73,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'll put it on for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.73,0:18:30.41,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.70,0:18:31.64,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.64,0:18:33.51,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,O-Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.90,0:18:45.11,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.11,0:18:49.68,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, \NI'm always on your side, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.08,0:18:55.19,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You never change, Izumi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.72,0:18:57.24,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.24,0:19:01.29,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,A friend just told me the \Nother day that I've changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.84,0:19:06.03,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'm sure that's just because your good parts\N are showing through more.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.76,0:19:08.96,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Everyone's starting to see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.66,0:19:13.83,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,And I... I should be happy \Nabout that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.18,0:19:21.21,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I don't know why... \Nbut it bothers me a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.87,0:19:25.38,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,What if you end up drifting \Nfar away from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.54,0:19:29.08,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,What am I even talking about, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.87,0:19:38.65,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Please don't ever change. \NStay the way you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.73,0:19:41.85,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You don't trust me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.85,0:19:43.57,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Of course I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.35,0:19:46.64,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,But... But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.50,0:19:50.28,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You say I haven't changed,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.34,0:19:54.89,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,but I think I've changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.46,0:19:58.26,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,A year ago, you changed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.13,0:20:01.76,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,But it's not enough yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.13,0:20:07.27,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,If the way I am now makes you \Nworry, I'll get stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.30,0:20:10.60,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I can't be as cool as you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.34,0:20:13.96,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,but I do want to get stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.78,0:20:19.85,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I want to put your mind at ease\N so you'll trust me as much as I trust you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.68,0:20:24.55,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,and so you can relax and \Nsmile when you're with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.03,0:20:31.53,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.46,0:20:35.51,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I want the same thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.51,0:20:36.70,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You're crying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.78,0:20:39.95,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You're already not smiling!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.95,0:20:42.62,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,...s-same... same thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.98,0:20:45.92,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,What'd you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.93,0:20:46.43,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(578,127)\an8\fnArial\b1\fs30\c&HDC6F61&\bord0\shad0}Sob
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.43,0:20:46.93,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial\b1\fs30\c&HDC6F61&\bord0\shad0\pos(264,294)}Sob
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.93,0:20:47.43,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial\b1\fs30\c&HDC6F61&\bord0\shad0\pos(546,190)}Sob
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.43,0:20:47.93,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(578,127)\an8\fnArial\b1\fs30\c&HDC6F61&\bord0\shad0}Sob
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.93,0:20:48.43,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial\b1\fs30\c&HDC6F61&\bord0\shad0\pos(264,294)}Sob
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.43,0:20:48.68,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(578,127)\an8\fnArial\b1\fs30\c&HDC6F61&\bord0\shad0}Sob
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.96,0:20:52.66,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,This is the first time I've seen you cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.66,0:20:54.95,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You don't need to offer your opinions!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.97,0:20:59.28,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Anyway, please stop crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.44,0:21:11.00,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I've made up my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.10,0:21:13.69,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.13,0:21:20.41,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,No matter what kind of sweet, pretty, \Nalluring girl may come along...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.87,0:21:26.72,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'm never going to let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.80,0:21:29.81,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,O-Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.18,0:21:34.48,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Oh! I-It's really late. \NWe should head home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.82,0:21:36.83,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.92,0:21:45.30,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Does it look nice on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.65,0:21:47.52,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.22,0:21:52.54,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,My girlfriend is super cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.84,0:22:54.81,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(560,440)\fnArial\b1\fs22.5\frz7\shad0\3c&HDBE6E5&\c&H5126E8&\pos(498,223.499)}S{\fs21\c&H3DCEFE&}E{\fs19.5\c&H5126E8&}E {\fs19.5\c&H3DCEFE&}Y{\fs18\c&H5126E8&}O{\fs16.5\c&H3DCEFE&}U{\c&H5126E8&}~
